  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Apprisal UNDP/CBF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bed&#xF6;mning av UNDP/CBF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I maj &#xE5;r 2001 fick Sida ett projektf&#xF6;rslag fr&#xE5;n UNDP i Serbien/FRJ ang st&#xF6;d till uppbygnad av en fond f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;rvaltningsreform av Serbiens ministerier. UNDP utarbetade under sommaren fyra projektf&#xF6;rslag och Sida har i dialog med UNDP och andra givare valt att be Sipu unders&#xF6;k f&#xF6;ruts&#xE4;ttningarna f&#xF6;r st&#xF6;d till Serbiens &quot;Ministry of Labour&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In May 2001 Sida received a project proposal from UNDP in Serbia/FRY: &quot;Support to the Capacity Building Fund&quot; which is aiming at supporting the reformactivities of Ministries in FRY. UNDP developed four detailed projectproposals and SIda has commissioned Sipu to apprise the proposal of support to the Ministry of Labour and Employment</narrative>
  </description>
